megu is a clean-room, Minecraft-compatible dedicated server written in Rust
with an optional native GPU game client (wgpu/winit; Vulkan on FreeBSD).

The server handles the vanilla 1.21.1 protocol surface plus datapacks, mod
offload and world tooling; the client renders the game without any Mojang
code. All components ship under LGPL-3.0-or-later.
